A stacked first-block plus takes a follower only at its innermost opener's marker column

```
- - > +
  b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote>

        </blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
    b
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- - +
  b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - - > +
  b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <blockquote>

            </blockquote>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
    b
  </li>
</ul>
```
